<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="965768365"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:45.267"><div begin="22.092" end="35.962" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="22.092" end="25.517" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.092" end="22.601">风雨</span><span begin="22.601" end="23.004">过后</span><span begin="23.004" end="23.980">不一定有</span><span begin="23.980" end="24.926">美好的天</span><span begin="24.926" end="25.517">空</span></p><p begin="25.785" end="28.371" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.785" end="26.720">不是天晴</span><span begin="26.720" end="27.637">就会有彩</span><span begin="27.637" end="28.371">虹</span></p><p begin="28.944" end="32.591" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.944" end="29.486">所以</span><span begin="29.486" end="30.241">你</span><span begin="30.853" end="31.362">一脸</span><span begin="31.362" end="31.813">无</span><span begin="31.813" end="32.591">辜</span></p><p begin="32.962" end="35.962" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.962" end="33.166">不</span><span begin="33.166" end="33.623">代</span><span begin="33.623" end="34.186">表</span><span begin="34.186" end="34.429">你</span><span begin="34.429" end="35.080">懵</span><span begin="35.080" end="35.962">懂</span></p></div><div begin="36.889" end="50.971" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="36.889" end="40.322" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.889" end="37.764">不是所有</span><span begin="37.764" end="38.737">感情都会</span><span begin="38.737" end="39.210">有始</span><span begin="39.210" end="39.672">有</span><span begin="39.672" end="40.322">终</span></p><p begin="40.560" end="43.205" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.560" end="41.458">孤独尽头</span><span begin="41.458" end="42.136">不一定</span><span begin="42.136" end="42.468">惶</span><span begin="42.468" end="43.205">恐</span></p><p begin="43.773" end="47.206" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.773" end="44.230">可生</span><span begin="44.230" end="45.061">命</span><span begin="45.468" end="45.879">总</span><sp